        "original_id": "4bd388e6-6fdf-5874-a2fb-7ff4a34114d2",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Baidu Baike, Chinese Wikipedia\n- Organizations: Wikimedia Foundation\n- Concepts: Baidu 10 Mythical Creatures, Internet meme\n- Places: People's Republic of China\n\nFacts:\n- On 20 April 2006, Baidu Baike released its test version.\n- Within three weeks of its test release, Baidu Baike grew to more than 90,000 articles and surpassed Chinese Wikipedia in article count.\n- Chinese Wikipedia is the Standard Chinese-language edition of Wikipedia.\n- The Wikimedia Foundation runs Chinese Wikipedia.\n- In early 2009, the Baidu 10 Mythical Creatures began as a humorous hoax from Baidu Baike.\n- In early 2009, the Baidu 10 Mythical Creatures became a popular and widespread Internet meme in the People's Republic of China.",
